      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Legend\n  blue = E7-2 analytics code      green = E7-1 shell code      grey = outside the binary\n  red = failure path and the states it produces      orange = degraded-but-continuing\n  purple = the single-source artifacts of ADR-0007      dashed red = process boundary\n\nThe mechanism to read off this: parse.rs is reachable only from a &str, so every FR-1 case is a\nunit test with no disk and no TTY; and no analytics failure reaches error_screen.rs, because only\nthe screen can say \"here are your last good numbers, they are stale\".",
      "originalText": "Legend\n  blue = E7-2 analytics code      green = E7-1 shell code      grey = outside the binary\n  red = failure path and the states it produces      orange = degraded-but-continuing\n  purple = the single-source artifacts of ADR-0007      dashed red = process boundary\n\nThe mechanism to read off this: parse.rs is reachable only from a &str, so every FR-1 case is a\nunit test with no disk and no TTY; and no analytics failure reaches error_screen.rs, because only\nthe screen can say \"here are your last good numbers, they are stale\".",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 10
    }
